// `of` as a GOVERNED complement marker ("MSI consists of repeats", "composed of") — `of` had only a
// noun-post-modifier entry, so a verb governing `of` had no derivation at all (0 readings).
resource lexicon:of_arg : lexicon:LexicalEntry {
    core:description = "grammatical: argument-marker preposition for a verb governing `of` ('consists of X').";
    lexicon:form     = "of";
